<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Tosco restarted as buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Tosco restarted as buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- CS First Boston said it reinstated coverage of Tosco Corp as a buy.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Tosco gained 1/8 to 30-7/8.</p>
